Third-party (nothing below is vendored; models are downloaded by the user or on first use):
- Mel-Band RoFormer architecture (Wang et al., 2023), re-implemented here from the paper. The vocal
  checkpoint it loads is MIT-licensed and is not included in this repository.
- MediaPipe Face Landmarker model (Google, Apache-2.0) and YuNet face detector (OpenCV Zoo, MIT): downloaded
  on first use, checksum-verified.
- DINOv2 (Meta, Apache-2.0), Florence-2 (Microsoft, MIT), SAM 2.1 (Meta, Apache-2.0; the sam2 package),
  Whisper weights via faster-whisper (MIT), SoundSwallower + CMUdict (BSD), g2p (MIT): loaded at run time.
- Generator models run through ComfyUI: LTX-2.5 (Lightricks, under its model licence), Qwen-Image-Edit-2511
  (Alibaba Qwen, Apache-2.0), ACE-Step 1.5 (under its model licence).
- The demo assets (released separately, Apache-2.0) are original: synthetic characters generated with LTX-2.5
  and Qwen-Image-Edit, a song generated with ACE-Step, and a lip kit generated by LSDub with Qwen-Image-Edit.
